   \]

5. **Entropy change of the water:**
   The entropy change of the water is:
   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{water}} = \frac{Q_{\text{water}}}{ T_{\text{vaporization}}} = \frac{1858.5}{220} = 8.41 \text{ kJ/K}
   \]

6. **Total entropy change:**
   The total entropy change is the sum of the entropy changes of the gas and the water:
   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{total}} = \Delta S_{\text{gas}} + \Delta S_{\text{water}} = 0.64 + 8.41 = 9.05 \text{ kJ/K}
   \]

